      'winner ((h,a),(x,y)) | x > y = h | x < y = a | otherwise = "draw"\n\nCompara os golos das duas equipas; a igualdade é empate.',
  },
  {
    n: 2,
    stem: 'Implement matchDayScore :: String -> MatchDay -> Int, which, given a team and a matchday, returns the score obtained by that team\non their match of that matchday. Winning a match gives a team 3 points, drawing gives 1 point and losing gives 0 points. If the input\nteam does not exist in the league, then return 0.\nExamples:\nghci> matchDayScore "Porto" (myLeague !! 0)\n1\nghci> matchDayScore "Benfica" (myLeague !! 0)\n3\nghci> matchDayScore "Vitoria SC" (myLeague !! 0)\n0',
    starter:
      league +
      'matchDayScore :: String -> MatchDay -> Int\nmatchDayScore = undefined',
    tests: [
      {
        name: 'Empate',
        code: 'main = print (matchDayScore "Porto" (myLeague !! 0))',
        output: '1',
      },
      {
        name: 'Vitória',
        code: 'main = print (matchDayScore "Benfica" (myLeague !! 0))',
        output: '3',
      },
      {
        name: 'Derrota',
        code: 'main = print (matchDayScore "Vitoria SC" (myLeague !! 0))',
        output: '0',
      },
      {
        name: 'Ausente',
        code: 'main = print (matchDayScore "X" [])',
